    {
      "title": "10. Crate Hopper",
      "instructions": "Put your detour in a function: turn left, walk 100, turn right, walk 200, turn right, walk 100, turn left. Then use a loop to repeat it. Keep clear of the laser.",
      "starterCode": "def around_crate():\n    turn(-90)\n    step(100)\n    # finish the detour\n\nstep(100)\n",
